{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/322c4045fce6ccbeb8076265d1312e00.avif?t=1757079766\" width=616 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A charming action adventure where you fight viruses alongside adorable immune cells!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viruses have invaded the body! As a doctor, you'll control immune cells to fight infections and experience the joy of growing stronger with each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve into cells with different weapons and abilities every time as you nurture your very own special immune cell. An exciting adventure awaits with these lovable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddec Special Fun Elements You Can Experience in Supre-Immune</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/09fe7d21151d7a4c02ce30fcd7131714.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike action game set in the human immune system! With a structure of fast-paced combat and strategic growth, it offers the joy of new challenges and growth every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/92ac003b2a8b04d60e63965657e9b8d7.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immune cells with round eyes and expressive personalities are waiting for you! With their cute design featuring cell nuclei and cell membranes, you'll find yourself smiling even during intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/128725b76a894b2a7e60bfdde6436dd3.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex controls needed! Anyone can easily enjoy the game with simple movement controls. Since weapons automatically find and attack enemies, you can focus solely on strategic positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4adfd2ec0d847bc690d0649fbf9a87a9.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most exciting moment begins when combat ends! Use collected data to evolve into cells with new weapons and special abilities. Completely different adventures unfold depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4234a0423625dd03a3427ca6a9e26fbc.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience points every time you evolve, leading to level-ups! With this special system where evolution and growth happen simultaneously, you'll feel the satisfaction of your character getting stronger every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/1e9c989ddee6844989bd58e55acadcc0.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/1e9c989ddee6844989bd58e55acadcc0.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/1e9c989ddee6844989bd58e55acadcc0.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/229f644081c5526cf7d438c0670e991f.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The same immune cell can become a close-combat warrior or a long-range attack master depending on your choices. Create your own unique combat style with unimaginable combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4627ead83fe673a2886811bdbc4562a1.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4627ead83fe673a2886811bdbc4562a1.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4627ead83fe673a2886811bdbc4562a1.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/a0463a47f3970949bd45c014cfeccf49.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just ordinary combat! Sudden environmental changes and reliable supply bot appearances create unexpected events that make your adventure even more thrilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/e56a0e2448fb51a8e0c8cd7aa8cb5012.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/e56a0e2448fb51a8e0c8cd7aa8cb5012.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/e56a0e2448fb51a8e0c8cd7aa8cb5012.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/b96914ed8a6fde3e9deaa3e08e7ff929.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of your adventure, massive and powerful bosses await! Elite monsters that appear throughout provide greater challenges and rewards. It's time to show the true power of the immune cell you've grown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/ff2df5ca398a2f437499f83ec755c89c.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/ff2df5ca398a2f437499f83ec755c89c.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/ff2df5ca398a2f437499f83ec755c89c.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grand adventure with small, adorable immune cells begins.</i></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3455320/c37fbb5a8794bd10f46dd09dff164a791ac7565e.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3455320/20e010daf87e1f076feee095a167b39e2112baf7.jpg"},{"name":"Growing Pains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3455320/f4c98b4abfd0d3240a767a4bbd31a2da89b2168a.jpg"},{"name":"Beginning of Trials","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3455320/e11bfa9f252136966d4275fe951ea02a227c0054.jpg"},{"name":"Super Immunity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3455320/445bfa6481d4d40e5b8552843325730e76017313.jpg"},{"name":"Crying Fists","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3455320/549b29892777a01796a811c905b42841f0c30b43.jpg"},{"name":"Art of Distance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3455320/c27ef9eff9fa238ce2373af84e4977a0d6a7cdaa.jpg"},{"name":"Physical Compensation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3455320/3f941aee117b90d0bb70d09569c1ba2e8bcd7acc.jpg"},{"name":"Endless Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3455320/5949e62bc578827243183f649ad6fd8b821fa95e.jpg"},{"name":"Rapid Growth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3455320/6bc24287391d4aab809dbd82c3e8cdfffed2c5ed.jpg"}],"total":54},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3455320?t=1757079766","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3455320?t=1757079766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/6c0196ef97d9f99774b9dc9f57811f8ab6f910fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757079766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/6c0196ef97d9f99774b9dc9f57811f8ab6f910fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757079766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/322c4045fce6ccbeb8076265d1312e00.avif?t=1757079766\" width=616 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A charming action adventure where you fight viruses alongside adorable immune cells!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viruses have invaded the body! As a doctor, you'll control immune cells to fight infections and experience the joy of growing stronger with each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve into cells with different weapons and abilities every time as you nurture your very own special immune cell. An exciting adventure awaits with these lovable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddec Special Fun Elements You Can Experience in Supre-Immune</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/09fe7d21151d7a4c02ce30fcd7131714.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike action game set in the human immune system! With a structure of fast-paced combat and strategic growth, it offers the joy of new challenges and growth every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/46ccd66dfb00e1aa82edad0cefb38a16.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/92ac003b2a8b04d60e63965657e9b8d7.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immune cells with round eyes and expressive personalities are waiting for you! With their cute design featuring cell nuclei and cell membranes, you'll find yourself smiling even during intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/fb7bf778e450b63216cf3514c43f8a8d.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/128725b76a894b2a7e60bfdde6436dd3.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex controls needed! Anyone can easily enjoy the game with simple movement controls. Since weapons automatically find and attack enemies, you can focus solely on strategic positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/8482630a2009919a7718acb238e14eaa.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4adfd2ec0d847bc690d0649fbf9a87a9.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most exciting moment begins when combat ends! Use collected data to evolve into cells with new weapons and special abilities. Completely different adventures unfold depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/72193960cc60ae9789792c892a8e750f.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4234a0423625dd03a3427ca6a9e26fbc.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience points every time you evolve, leading to level-ups! With this special system where evolution and growth happen simultaneously, you'll feel the satisfaction of your character getting stronger every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/1e9c989ddee6844989bd58e55acadcc0.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/1e9c989ddee6844989bd58e55acadcc0.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/1e9c989ddee6844989bd58e55acadcc0.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/229f644081c5526cf7d438c0670e991f.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The same immune cell can become a close-combat warrior or a long-range attack master depending on your choices. Create your own unique combat style with unimaginable combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4627ead83fe673a2886811bdbc4562a1.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4627ead83fe673a2886811bdbc4562a1.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/4627ead83fe673a2886811bdbc4562a1.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/a0463a47f3970949bd45c014cfeccf49.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just ordinary combat! Sudden environmental changes and reliable supply bot appearances create unexpected events that make your adventure even more thrilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/e56a0e2448fb51a8e0c8cd7aa8cb5012.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/e56a0e2448fb51a8e0c8cd7aa8cb5012.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/e56a0e2448fb51a8e0c8cd7aa8cb5012.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/b96914ed8a6fde3e9deaa3e08e7ff929.avif?t=1757079766\" width=601 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of your adventure, massive and powerful bosses await! Elite monsters that appear throughout provide greater challenges and rewards. It's time to show the true power of the immune cell you've grown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/ff2df5ca398a2f437499f83ec755c89c.poster.avif?t=1757079766\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/ff2df5ca398a2f437499f83ec755c89c.webm?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/extras/ff2df5ca398a2f437499f83ec755c89c.mp4?t=1757079766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grand adventure with small, adorable immune cells begins.</i></strong></p>","developers":["Indion"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455320/716986babf8aa516c04ba2b841f54f029a88ac00/header.jpg?t=1757079766","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257139689,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139689/movie480.mp4?t=1756721484","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139689/movie_max.mp4?t=1756721484